CHAPTER.VERS:
Isn't Yahweh your

          {+}
         God with you

          {+}
        ? And has he not given you

          {+}
         rest on every side? For he has delivered the inhabitants of the land into my hand; and the land is subdued before Yahweh, and before his people.

Now set your

          {+}
         heart and your

          {+}
         soul to seek after Yahweh your

          {+}
         God; arise therefore, and build

          {+}
         the sanctuary of Yahweh God, to bring the ark of the covenant of Yahweh, and the holy vessels of God, into the house that is to be built to the name of Yahweh.
